<v Host>It means a space probe — an unmanned spacecraft that explores.

00:04:02.711 --> 00:04:19.968
<v Slow>トリフネは、地球から約700万キロ離れたところにある小惑星です。2024年に「トリフネ」という正式な名前がつけられました。

00:04:20.767 --> 00:04:28.663
<v Host>Torifune is an asteroid about seven million kilometers from Earth. It was given the name Torifune in twenty twenty-four.

00:04:29.264 --> 00:04:31.567
<v Vocab>離れる

00:04:31.968 --> 00:04:35.903
<v Host>It means to be far away, or separated by some distance.

