00:04:53.120 --> 00:05:00.319
<v Host>It is about seven hundred meters long with a slender shape. It's thought to spin around once about every five hours.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:03.103
<v Vocab>回る

00:05:03.504 --> 00:05:06.240
<v Host>It means to spin or turn around.

00:05:06.839 --> 00:05:17.663
<v Slow>そして2時間前からは、探査機が自分で判断して進む「自律航法」に切り替えました。

00:05:18.463 --> 00:05:26.000
<v Host>Then, from two hours before, it switched to autonomous navigation, flying by its own judgment.

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:28.831
<v Vocab>判断

00:05:29.232 --> 00:05:32.567
<v Host>It means judgment, or making a decision.

00:05:33.168 --> 00:05:43.247
<v Slow>このとき、はやぶさ2はトリフネの中心から約800メートルまで近づく予定でした。

00:05:44.048 --> 00:05:51.103
<v Host>At that moment, Hayabusa2 was set to come within about eight hundred meters of Torifune's center.

00:05:51.704 --> 00:05:54.151
<v Vocab>近づく

00:05:54.552 --> 00:05:57.408
<v Host>It means to come closer, to approach.

00:05:58.007 --> 00:06:10.415
